{"id":"5b1910329dd492ae77fddf218552d2acc2ae4a73","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230200","title":"deepseek 是不是在偷偷读取 gemini 的信息尼？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"BaiLinfeng","excerpt":"程序员 - @BaiLinfeng - 比如说，我问 DeepSeek 的问题，DeepSeek 他不太知道和清楚的情况下，然后他回答了其他的不太相关的答案。并没回答出问题的精髓，然后我接着就问谷歌的 Gemini 。谷歌九精准的发现了这个","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>比如说，我问 DeepSeek 的问题，DeepSeek 他不太知道和清楚的情况下，然后他回答了其他的不太相关的答案。并没回答出问题的精髓，然后我接着就问谷歌的 Gemini 。谷歌九精准的发现了这个问题的精髓，回答出来了，还不错，那么接下来我返回 deepseek 再次问 DeepSeek 。这下 DeepSeek 就回答出精髓了，居然给谷歌 Gemini 说的话几乎是一模一样的答案。我在想第一次我问 deepseek 它并不知道答案的，我问了 gemin 后，DeepSeek 是怎么就马上知道答案了尼？ deepseek 是读取谷歌本地缓存的信息吗？神奇？我好几次发现这个问题了。大家是否有注意到过。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/信息\"><li></li> 信息</a><a href=\"/tag/读取\"><li></li> 读取</a></P><p><span>36 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-28 11:08:25 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909070\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0239/c4ab/193625_normal.png?m=1711423516\" alt=\"qk3z\" data-uid=\"193625\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qk3z\">qk3z</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 17:55:34 +08:00\">23h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>？？？懂了，deepseek 监控了你的电脑，hhhh</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909242\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4ff5343ede1b675e9cdf55e23cf7973?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kpprotector\" data-uid=\"609301\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kpprotector\">kpprotector</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 18:30:19 +08:00\">22h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>deepseek 靠什么读取 gemini 信息啊……<br>又不是 NextChat 那种项目，历史记录都存本地，就算存本地 deepseek 哪有权限……</p><p>而且得重新训练之后更新之后，知识才能更新啊。</p><p>看不到任何的可行路径。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909268\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c98db88a0793a8b6839d9d93e09b5835?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jadehare\" data-uid=\"398633\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jadehare\">jadehare</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 18:38:55 +08:00\">22h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>对话内容都可以提供一下，看能不能复现。deepseek 也支持联网查询，是不是第一次问的时候没有开这个功能。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909340\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ad/a1cc/89138_normal.png?m=1712046413\" alt=\"cctv6\" data-uid=\"89138\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cctv6\">cctv6</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 19:05:02 +08:00\">21h 55m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉你是在同一个会话里面用了两个模型，切换之后肯定是可以看到之前的历史对话的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93c307f34530b473663c1976d0711559?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chenluo0429\" data-uid=\"330532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chenluo0429\">chenluo0429</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 19:42:46 +08:00\">21h 18m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>并非如此，deepseek 实际上偷偷读取的是你的脑波。这种仗着技术领先，未经允许侵犯个人隐私的行为值得唾弃！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909626\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c2acd7d4430c57e93f3dd4dc6448a42?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jetsung\" data-uid=\"779164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jetsung\">jetsung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 21:12:28 +08:00\">19h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>首先，你是用软件问的，还是在 WEB 问的？<br>如果你用软件问的，那没有什么好说的。让大家来说。</p><p>如果是对应官方 WEB CHAT ，那再复现一次看看以确定你心中的答案。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909782\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0171/ea51/664376_normal.png?m=1744749478\" alt=\"lysShub\" data-uid=\"664376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lysShub\">lysShub</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 22:41:10 +08:00\">18h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你该不会在同一个 session 中切的 model 吧？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909793\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fbb5/85d0/354022_normal.png?m=1568342682\" alt=\"geekvcn\" data-uid=\"354022\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geekvcn\">geekvcn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 22:51:14 +08:00\">18h 9m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>楼主是 AI 带节奏机器人？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909809\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aa77/9e8f/63973_normal.png?m=1780929087\" alt=\"5GA\" data-uid=\"63973\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/5GA\">5GA</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 23:01:32 +08:00\">17h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/geekvcn\">geekvcn</a> 可能是通过发帖，吸引人注意，然后引出一楼的广告吧。</p><p>我实在无法想象能够接触到 AI 的人，居然能“想到”和“认可”这种解释。。。。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909919\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fca9/de4f/133263_normal.png?m=1702207426\" alt=\"PolarBears\" data-uid=\"133263\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PolarBears\">PolarBears</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 00:30:41 +08:00\">16h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你的意思是 DeepSeek 击穿了浏览器的沙箱机制然后读取哈基米的聊天记录来回答吗😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909946\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_normal.png?m=1785175765\" alt=\"dirstart\" data-uid=\"417579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dirstart\">dirstart</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 01:05:20 +08:00\">15h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>google cloud 最近用了下，体验不佳，我白冲了 25$，也没法退；<br>google flow ，完全无法编辑；<br>gemini 不说了==，codex ~ claude code &gt; grok &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; gemini</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c18/0d1d/67392_normal.png?m=1428157078\" alt=\"dacapoday\" data-uid=\"67392\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dacapoday\">dacapoday</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 08:46:02 +08:00\">8h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>web search tool 的问题? deepseek 官方的 web search 是闭源的, 可能它的真实供应商是谷歌?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910464\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f39f/cabd/660117_normal.png?m=1715408332\" alt=\"gloeaerris\" data-uid=\"660117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gloeaerris\">gloeaerris</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 09:24:39 +08:00\">7h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/BaiLinfeng\">BaiLinfeng</a> #11 你这标题不是知道为什么这样吗？就是 deepseek 偷 gemini 的答案呗~<br>这要是换成 claude 在 gemini 回答之后回答正确，那就只会是 gemini 偷 claude 不会是 claude 偷 gemini ，但 deepseek 就不是了，因为它不是美国的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910905\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f7f9a3d30693d23ea99d411c7bc25afd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Meursau1T\" data-uid=\"565652\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Meursau1T\">Meursau1T</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 10:14:35 +08:00\">6h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>本身大模型的回答就是随机的，deepseek 在 5 次内有 1 次回答正确的概率跟顶级模型没什么差别，更别说 gemini 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div i